289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 34 0 R
/E (The Indian Academy of Environmental Sciences \(IAES\), Haridwar, established in 1986, is a premier scientific organization dedicated to advancing research, education, and public awareness in environmental sciences and allied disciplines. Headquartered in Haridwar, Uttarakhand, the Academy promotes interdisciplinary research through national and international conferences, seminars, workshops, and publications. IAES publishes the peer-reviewed Journal of Environment and Bio-Sciences \(JEBS\) and recognizes outstanding scientific contributions through fellowships and prestigious awards. With a strong commitment to environmental conservation, sustainable development, and scientific collaboration, the Academy serves as a distinguished platform for researchers, academicians, policymakers, and environmental professionals in India and abroad.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [71]
>>
endobj
290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 34 0 R
/E (Absolute Human Care Foundation \(AHCF\) is a non-profit organization established in 2017 and dedicated to improving the lives of underserved communities through initiatives in health, education, agriculture, and skill development. With a strong focus on public health and vector-borne disease prevention, AHCF promotes capacity building, research, and community awareness. Through its impactful programmes and collaborative efforts, the Foundation continues to contribute towards building a healthier, more sustainable, and empowered society.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [72]
>>
